# Edge-case vectors pinning down behaviour the acceptance test leaves open.
# Expected outputs were derived by hand from the rules at the top of alarm.c.
### limits-are-strict-and-deadband-reentry-restarts-return-timer
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=30 escalate=0
init 0
s 0 30
s 40 30
s 50 31
s 80 31
s 90 28
s 130 28
s 140 27.5
s 160 29
s 170 27
tick 199
tick 200
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
NORMAL
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@80:31.000
HIGH
HIGH
HIGH
HIGH
HIGH
HIGH
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@200:27.000
