### sensor-fault-nan-inf
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=30 escalate=0
init 0
s 0 20
sf 10 20
sf 20 20
s 30 20
s 40 nan
s 50 inf
s 60 35
s 89 35
s 90 35
s 100 -inf
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
FAULT TO_FAULT@10:20.000
FAULT
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@30:20.000
FAULT TO_FAULT@40:nan
FAULT
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@60:35.000
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@90:35.000
FAULT TO_FAULT@100:-inf
